" :SongwriterAddDashes (songwriter#tab#AddDashes): append `--` to every string
" of the tab block.

Given (AddDashes appends -- to all tab lines in the block):
  e|-----------4--|--1-----------|
  B|--------1-----|-----2-----2--|
  G|--3-----0--0--|-----1--0--0--|
  D|--------1-----|-----1--------|
  A|--4--3--------|--1-----1-----|
  E|--3-----------|--1-----------|

Execute (AddDashes appends -- to all tab lines in the block):
  call cursor(6, 1)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDashes()
Expect:
  e|-----------4--|--1-----------|--
  B|--------1-----|-----2-----2--|--
  G|--3-----0--0--|-----1--0--0--|--
  D|--------1-----|-----1--------|--
  A|--4--3--------|--1-----1-----|--
  E|--3-----------|--1-----------|--

Given (works when cursor is on any string line):
  e|---------|
  B|---------|
  G|---------|
  D|---------|
  A|---------|
  E|---------|

Execute (works when cursor is on any string line):
  call cursor(3, 1)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDashes()
Expect:
  e|---------|--
  B|---------|--
  G|---------|--
  D|---------|--
  A|---------|--
  E|---------|--

Given (does not affect non-tab lines):
  e|---------|
  B|---------|
  G|---------|
  D|---------|
  A|---------|
  E|---------|
  some prose line
  another line

Execute (does not affect non-tab lines):
  call cursor(1, 1)
  call songwriter#tab#AddDashes()
Then:
  AssertEqual 'e|---------|--', getline(1)
  AssertEqual 'some prose line', getline(7)
